let __v_761 = Value::from("A bang is not a sound a machine makes when it is well: something is loose inside it or is being hit, so empty it and find that before you run it again. Turn the part that moves by hand and listen for where the noise is, and check the machine stands level and is not touching the cupboard or the wall beside it. A machine that still bangs empty and standing flat wants an engineer rather than another load.");
