let __v_809 = Value::from("Retrace the last hour in order and check the boring places again - coat pocket, under the car seat, the last counter you were at. If they are really gone: the spare first, then whoever else has a set, and with no spare change the barrel rather than hope, which a locksmith does for about £60 to £120. If the ring had your address on it, do that today.");
frame.store("LOST_HOUSE_KEYS_REPLY", __v_809.clone())?;
let __v_810 = Value::from("Search the car properly before anything else - between the seats, the door pocket, the boot, and the pockets of the coat you wore. If it is gone, a car key is a dealer or an auto locksmith job: about £150 to £250 to cut and code a new one, and you need the V5 and photo ID. If it was stolen rather than mislaid, ring your insurer before you replace it, because theft cover often pays.");
frame.store("LOST_CAR_KEYS_REPLY", __v_810.clone())?;
