let __v_853 = Value::from("Wipe it off with a mould spray, or a dilute bleach solution wearing gloves, and then find the water it is living on, because mould on a dry wall does not come back: a window frame wants the gap round it checked and the trickle vent opened, a cold outside wall wants air moving past it, and a corner behind furniture wants the furniture pulled out. Keeping the room warm and ventilated for a few weeks does more than any spray. If it keeps returning in the same place, that patch is a damp problem, not dirt.");
