let __v_906 = Value::from("Stop using it: a kettle that boils dry is not cutting out, and the steam switch in the lid or the strip in the base that should cut it is the part that has failed. Scale can hold that switch shut, so descale it once - half water, half white vinegar, boil, leave it an hour, rinse - and try it again with the lid on and shut, because the steam has to reach the switch for it to work. Watch that next boil, and if it still refuses to click off, bin it: a kettle costs less than the repair, and one that has already boiled dry can scorch its element, melt the plastic round it or trip the house electrics.");
