let __v_1378 = pyrt::literals::decode("{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"boiler\",\"gas boiler\",\"gas fire\",\"gas hob\",\"gas cooker\",\"gas work\",\"gas engineer\"]},\"A Gas Safe engineer, not a general plumber: gas work is theirs by law and a plumber without the ticket cannot touch it. Ask for a fixed call-out price, say what the boiler is doing, and check their number on the Gas Safe Register before you book.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"electrics\",\"electrical\",\"electrician\",\"wiring\",\"socket\",\"sockets\",\"fuse box\",\"consumer unit\",\"lighting\",\"tripping\",\"trips\",\"short circuit\",\"rcd\"]},\"A registered electrician, not a handyman: the wiring, the sockets, the fuse box and lights that keep tripping are theirs, and in the UK the work has to be certified. Say whether the whole house is off or only one circuit.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"roof\",\"roofs\",\"roofing\",\"roofer\",\"gutter\",\"gutters\",\"chimney\",\"flashing\",\"slate\",\"slates\",\"tile\",\"tiles\"]},\"A roofer, and ask them to find the leak rather than quote for a new roof: say where the stain is inside, and get a written quote with the scaffolding in it, because the scaffolding is often half the bill.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"drain\",\"drains\",\"drainage\",\"sewer\",\"sewers\",\"manhole\",\"soakaway\",\"septic tank\",\"outside pipe\",\"outside pipes\"]},\"A drain company, or a plumber if the slow one is a sink, a bath or a toilet: the drain firm has the rods and the camera. Ask the price to clear it and the price to camera it, because only the camera finds a collapsed pipe.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"window\",\"windows\",\"glass\",\"glazier\",\"patio door\",\"double glazing\",\"window pane\"]},\"A glazier for broken glass, and a window fitter or a carpenter for a frame that has dropped or will not shut. Say which one it is on the phone, and ask for the call-out price before they come.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"lock\",\"locks\",\"locksmith\",\"locked out\",\"broken key\",\"key snapped\",\"snapped in\"]},\"A locksmith, and ask what it costs to open the door before they set off: one who will not give a price on the phone charges by the hour at your door. Check they are local, and ask whether the price includes a new lock.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"door\",\"doors\",\"front door\",\"back door\",\"door frame\",\"sagging door\",\"garden gate\",\"gate\",\"gates\",\"fence\",\"fences\",\"fencing\",\"decking\",\"shed\",\"sheds\",\"joiner\",\"carpenter\"]},\"A joiner or carpenter for a door, a gate or a fence panel, and a locksmith instead if the lock is the part that has gone. Send a photo of the job first: a door that will not shut is often a hinge to adjust, and a fence panel is a panel rather than a visit.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"wasp\",\"wasps\",\"wasp nest\",\"nest\",\"mice\",\"mouse\",\"rat\",\"rats\",\"pest\",\"pests\",\"bedbugs\",\"bed bugs\",\"cockroach\",\"cockroaches\",\"squirrel\",\"squirrels\",\"pigeon\",\"pigeons\"]},\"A pest controller, and most give a price over the phone: say what you have seen and whether it is inside, because wasps in a loft and mice in a kitchen are different jobs. The council still does rats and mice in some areas, usually cheaper than a firm.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"damp\",\"damp patch\",\"wet patch\",\"mould\",\"mold\",\"condensation\",\"rising damp\"]},\"A damp surveyor, not a builder who sells the treatment: a wet patch is usually a leak, a gutter or water coming up, and a survey should name the water before anything is injected. Ask whether the survey is free and whether the firm sells the work as well.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"washing machine\",\"dishwasher\",\"tumble dryer\",\"tumble drier\",\"fridge\",\"freezer\",\"oven\",\"cooker\",\"appliance\",\"white goods\"]},\"A white-goods engineer who covers your make: the maker's own service while it is under warranty, otherwise a local one with reviews. Ask for a fixed call-out price, and weigh the quote against half the price of a new one.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"tree\",\"trees\",\"tree surgeon\",\"branch\",\"branches\",\"hedge\",\"hedges\",\"stump\",\"ivy\"]},\"A tree surgeon with insurance, and ask to see the certificate before anyone climbs: say how close the tree is to the house or the wires, and get the price for taking the waste away, because that is often half the cost.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"leak\",\"leaks\",\"leaking\",\"drip\",\"dripping\",\"pipe\",\"pipes\",\"tap\",\"taps\",\"radiator\",\"radiators\",\"toilet\",\"shower\",\"sink\",\"bath\",\"stopcock\",\"water\"]},\"A plumber: a dripping pipe, a leak under a sink, a tap or a radiator is theirs. Turn the water off at the stopcock first, and ask for a fixed call-out price before they come.\"]}]}")?;
