let __v_1747 = Value::from("A heat pump, if the house is insulated and the radiators can be upsized: it is roughly £10,000 to £14,000 fitted before any grant, and one unit of electricity gives about three of heat, so it is the cheaper way to heat a well-insulated home. A new combi boiler is £2,000 to £3,000 fitted and the simpler answer for a draughty house with small radiators, where a heat pump would need every one of them replaced.");
