let __v_1877 = Value::from("The drawer is the front-left panel: pull it out and you have three compartments. The main wash (usually marked II) takes the powder, the liquid or the detergent. The small one marked I is the pre-wash and only matters if you choose that programme. The one with the flower symbol is the softener, filled to the MAX line and never over it. A tablet or a pod goes straight into the empty drum instead, before the washing, never in the drawer. If the machine has no drawer, the detergent goes in the little box inside the door.");
frame.store("_WASHER_DRAWER", __v_1877.clone())?;
let __v_1878 = Value::from("Dishwasher salt goes in the screw-cap well in the floor of the drum, under the bottom basket: fill it to the top using a funnel, because the water softener uses it up over a few weeks and the light comes on when it is low. Rinse aid goes in the smaller compartment in the door, the one with the dial - set that to 4 or 5. The tablet or powder goes in the dispenser behind the door flap, never in the cutlery basket.");
frame.store("_DISHWASHER_COMPARTMENTS", __v_1878.clone())?;
