let __v_5125 = Value::from("A nut and a bolt match on the thread, and the number in the name is the thread's diameter in millimetres: an M8 nut goes on an M8 bolt, which takes a 13mm spanner, and M6 takes 10mm, M10 takes 17mm and M12 takes 19mm. Take the bolt with you if you only need the nut, and a washer or a nyloc nut is what stops the joint shaking loose.");
